Deliberately NOT acquired
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Mali Vulkan driver (PanVK for Bifrost, community build)
  https://github.com/soulexit/panvk-bifrost-soulexit
  This build declares no licence. It therefore cannot be bundled with this
  application and this application does not download it. Vulkan support is
  optional: a user who wants it installs it themselves, and the launcher never
  selects the Vulkan route automatically.

Box86
  Copyright (c) ptitSeb — MIT License — https://github.com/ptitSeb/box86
  Not used. It is a 32-bit ARM program and would need a 32-bit userland that
  Android devices increasingly do not provide. The 32-bit game is hosted through
  WoW64 instead.

PRoot, glibc userland, VirGL
  Not used. Wine is built against Android's own Bionic libc, so there is no
  container and no separate Linux root filesystem in this runtime.

